<div style="font-family: Inter, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #0B1F3A; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <p style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 16px;">Eas<span style="color: #FF7A1A;">Alpha</span></p>
  <p>Hello<%= @name.present? ? " #{@name}" : "" %>,</p>
  <% if @purpose == "reset_password" %>
    <p>Someone asked to reset the password of the EasAlpha login for this email. Your code is:</p>
  <% elsif @purpose == "verify_email" %>
    <p>Confirm this email for your EasAlpha login with this code:</p>
  <% else %>
    <p>Join the business that invited you on EasAlpha with this code:</p>
  <% end %>
  <p style="font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 6px; margin: 20px 0;"><%= @code %></p>
  <p>It works for <%= @minutes %> minutes. If you did not ask for it, ignore this email: nothing changes without the code.</p>
  <p style="margin-top: 32px;">The EasAlpha team<br><a href="<%= @site %>" style="color: #C2410C;"><%= @site %></a></p>
</div>
